{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-18T18:11:42.889Z","author":"codex-sol","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.2-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"9402afe5eddc77f672cfcdc4","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.2-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/10","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-18T18:11:42.885Z","author":"codex-sol","text":"Round CN verified six CodeRabbit findings against d0968ee. Commit 309f8ee includes each fix and a regression.\nPRRT_kwDOU8IMzs65Dbxm -> 309f8ee resolves the nested tracker before policy and calibration reads.\nPRRT_kwDOU8IMzs65DbxD -> 309f8ee binds calibration to the admitted digest and abstains when the tag moves during admission.\nPRRT_kwDOU8IMzs65DbyN -> 309f8ee retains only validated input and output token counts in usage.\nPRRT_kwDOU8IMzs65DbyA -> 309f8ee rejects an explicitly empty limit through the packed CLI.\nPRRT_kwDOU8IMzs65Dbxz -> 309f8ee consumes the complete list after one host certification.\nPRRT_kwDOU8IMzs65Dbyx -> 309f8ee verifies three retained options and the case where the selected label is retained as a fourth.\nTypecheck, build:test, lint, duplication, docstrings, public provenance and release identity passed. The focused guard and calibration run passed 15/15. npm run coverage passed 462/462 with zero skips across 50 source files. c8 measured 8182/8182 statements and lines, 3945/3945 branches and 409/409 functions. Tag fetch, full changelog regeneration and changelog:check passed.\nAll four Node acceptance files passed, totaling 5 tests. Joint install timed out on the first Node 24 run and passed unchanged on Node 26. All eleven standalone acceptance files passed using verified public snapshots or synthetic fixtures, including the six-repository duplicate-quality and dedupe-calibration samples with 15 and 96 model calls respectively. Reports stayed in scratch storage."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-18T18:11:42.889Z"}],"before_hash":"e5bc8eb798406234254f992b40aceae8ed8377e1be51d22dc35a6573939b9b7d","after_hash":"a6bbf43c10d7b3b2e348fb3b537dd8970e1332e2d05e845055aaf71e65791e93","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"907ea49c1df55426420b21988992d6d366280132b13ab2cb9648c4db5d95a480"}
